{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch in. Let the madness begin. You're the sole toll booth operator on a remote desert highway. At first, it\u2019s routine: press the button, lift the gate, collect the cash. But routine doesn\u2019t last long out here. You plant strange seeds. You grow bizarre fruit. Soon, you're mixing mocktails and selling drinks to whoever rolls up to the gate. Run your station. Grow your crops. Cook. Serve. Survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.poster.avif?t=1774465205\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.webm?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.mp4?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage traffic through your toll gate. Accept payment, deny weirdos, or let them through just to see what happens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/62f71e355f99f087b87d98b661b376c0.poster.avif?t=1774465205\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/62f71e355f99f087b87d98b661b376c0.webm?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/62f71e355f99f087b87d98b661b376c0.mp4?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant exotic seeds. Harvest the fruits of your labor. <strong>Mix and sell cocktails</strong> with unpredictable and often alarming side effects. Some customers come back for more. Others don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.poster.avif?t=1774465205\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.webm?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.mp4?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farm your ingredients. Plant exotic seeds, water them with a tractor, and harvest bizarre fruits from mutating trees. Everything you need for the drinks... or something else entirely.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.poster.avif?t=1774465205\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.webm?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.mp4?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into houses, grab valuables, and escape before the sirens catch up. Some loot is worth the risk. Some not so much.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896300?t=1774465205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/0588049df24d2eba6d948f974e33329296cf0f05/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774465205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/aa78a2426bd4383309c3457166e3861df7d42b97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774465205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/aa78a2426bd4383309c3457166e3861df7d42b97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774465205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3944120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch in. Let the madness begin. You're the sole toll booth operator on a remote desert highway. At first, it\u2019s routine: press the button, lift the gate, collect the cash. But routine doesn\u2019t last long out here. You plant strange seeds. You grow bizarre fruit. Soon, you're mixing mocktails and selling drinks to whoever rolls up to the gate. Run your station. Grow your crops. Cook. Serve. Survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.poster.avif?t=1774465205\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.webm?t=1774465205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b